WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:00.510
I forbid anyone to open this gate

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:08.680
Stay where you are!

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.100
You can't just leave

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:15.400
What about the child?

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:19.280
Think about what they'll say about Do Hwa and that baby

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.650
They will gossip that the son is not yours,

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:24.990
that he is illegitimate

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:29.450
He will have the surname Chan since my wife gave birth to him.

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:32.500
I'll send someone to pick him up after the funeral

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.040
Are you leaving him?

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:36.580
He's true

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.880
not your son?

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.470
Believe what you want

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.470
If he's nothing but problems,

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.310
let's get rid of it here and now

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.480
Do you see? He is your son

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:07.410
The son you want to protect even at the cost of your life

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:09.740
I'm just trying to keep him safe

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:14.790
If his energy gates are not opened and he lives like my son, he will survive

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:18.420
But if he decides to try his luck,

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.670
death awaits him

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:26.260
Who is the father

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:28.840
child?

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.520
His father is dead

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:41.110
His birth has no meaning, moreover,

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:43.940
he shouldn't have been born at all

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.140
Assistant coordinators: Sana, Martini

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:51.700
Young Master, are you okay?

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:53.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, tommo

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.830
Why did you release her?

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:56.160
Let her go

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:27.150
Sorry for causing trouble

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.410
Why did you untie her?

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:35.120
She tried to poison you

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.700
She didn't try

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.370
I drank the poison myself

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:46.710
Because I couldn't cast spells

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.340
My maid only did what she was told. At the cost of his life

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.430
I ordered her

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:05.020
- Chan Wook, how could you?
- Wait with this

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:08.900
He hasn't fully recovered yet

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:12.490
Punish him as you wish, but after he recovers

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.370
Uk almost died

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:16.700
No need to scold him

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.450
He's all pale

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.920
Take him home bye

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.130
Mister, let's go

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:26.000
Go to Sejukwon, they will cure you there

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.630
Moo Deok needs to go there too

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:29.800
Now is not the time...

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.800
Moo Deok needs treatment too

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:33.470
Otherwise I won't go

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:34.760
Mister!

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:36.930
Well, great! Die then

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.890
- Lock them up again!
- Uncle, calm down

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.060
If Wook is telling the truth, it's not her fault.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.020
She is seriously injured

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.270
Without treatment she will die

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:49.610
I'm surprised she's still alive after all the beatings.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.910
If she dies, I'll let you conduct her funeral.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.800
Please help

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:16.430
Moo Deok risked her life to carry out my orders.

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:19.100
She must be taken to Sejukwon, otherwise she will not survive.

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:22.140
Help her

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:34.660
Get them out of my sight

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.620
Take them to Saejukwon

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:41.540
Uk...

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.210
Young master, go ahead. I'll bring Moo Deok

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:48.710
Moo Deok

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.380
Moo Deok, wake up

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:13.530
- I'll carry her
- No

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:16.410
I myself

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:17.950
You can't even stand on your feet

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:21.700
I can do it. She's my maid, I'll carry her myself

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.410
You can barely walk on your own

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.160
You can't get it there

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:29.170
Do you think so? Then...

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.840
- You will carry her on your back
- What?

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.210
Come on

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.800
- Do you want me to carry it?
- Yes

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.090
Why me?

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.680
- Come here
- Young Master

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:43.350
No. Wait. Heaven...

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.060
Holy heavens

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:48.400
Hey Yul. Listen...

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:50.060
Carry me instead of Moo Deok

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:54.740
I have no strength at all. Take me to Sejukwon

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:57.990
Do you want me to carry him?

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:02.280
- No
- Okay, thank you

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:04.120
Maid Kim, be careful!

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:05.750
- Be careful with her
- Okay

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:06.710
- Well...
- What...

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:08.790
Caution

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:13.630
As a result, Uk

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:17.630
opened the gates of energy

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:19.930
Yes

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:25.850
He risked his life. I couldn't just sit and watch

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:29.440
I think he understood

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:33.070
that we won't let him kill himself

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:36.530
He probably drank the poison himself,

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:38.280
so that we save him

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:43.620
Is everything okay?

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:48.790
Opening the Uka Gate and treating it

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:51.630
probably cost me ten years of energy

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:56.800
So you not only opened his gates, but also gave him energy?

00:07:56.880 --> 00:08:00.430
What should I, an old man, store my energy for?

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:03.140
He was poisoned

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:05.850
so I gave him the strength to recover quickly

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:09.850
When Uk is restored, you must return them

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:14.150
Is this really necessary when his gates are open?

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:18.400
He was 20 years late in learning spells

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:20.900
Even if he starts studying now,

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:25.740
learn something worthwhile by age 60

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:28.660
This is his destiny

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.040
We need to make sure of this

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:37.090
If you want it, I'll take the strength

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:38.300
You know what?

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:41.880
I'm too tired. I want to relax

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.850
Bring me some wine

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:49.930
Guilt?

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:53.100
That is...

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:57.480
Where does the wine in the practice room come from?

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.820
I saw

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:02.110
I saw that you kept it in yourself

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:05.530
Come on. The wine you drink when you're lonely

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.540
- I'm not alone!
- That's right

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:11.830
I'm completely...

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:13.120
Head hurts

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.040
This is because...

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:16.710
What was it called?

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.300
Exactly. Insomnia

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:20.710
I have terrible insomnia

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:24.680
I drink wine for insomnia

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:34.480
Loneliness keeps you from sleeping

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.860
You should have married in your youth

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:42.570
Have you forgotten Do Hwa yet? So lonely?

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.420
It's empty here

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:57.460
- What?
- You drank it all

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:01.250
It can't be. What?

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:06.510
What...

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:09.220
I think you were incredibly lonely

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:12.350
I only drank one drink when I couldn't sleep

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:14.560
Just one drink each time...

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:24.780
This is the wine that my uncle hid in his place

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:26.490
Tastes good

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:30.700
Finally, Uka's lifelong dream came true

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:32.040
Let's celebrate

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:34.200
That girl, Moo Deok...

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:36.330
He recently brought her from the gisaeng house, right?

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:41.340
She risked her life for him, even though they had just met.

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:44.630
This is weird

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:47.550
Wook saved her from becoming a gisaeng

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:50.930
She didn't want it so much that she pretended to be blind

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:52.680
Drink

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:53.970
"Blind"?

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:58.100
Yes. According to Joo Wol, she was blind when she arrived,

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.060
and as soon as I left there, I immediately saw the light

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.070
The wine is wonderful

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:05.360
She deceives people easily

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:09.610
She lied that she was blind and that she poisoned Uka

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:13.240
She remained silent despite the torture

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.450
There's more to her than meets the eye

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:18.080
Outwardly she is a sweet and naive girl

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.420
But she's clearly hiding something

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:29.800
- You drank it all
- What? What are you talking about?

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:33.560
Your uncle is coming here

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:35.140
I think you're doomed

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:38.770
- I didn't drink anything
- Wait, Yul

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:39.940
Yul!

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:44.070
- Mommies
- Dan Gu

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:47.490
I'm finished

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:50.530
Park Dan Goo

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:53.620
Is that you?

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:55.240
No

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:01.920
Come here

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:04.540
- Dan Gu
- Yes, uncle?

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:15.560
Is she breathing?

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:22.730
Woke up

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:25.900
You didn't come to your senses, you thought you might die

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.070
Does it hurt?

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.240
I think my bones are broken

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:39.080
Nothing's broken

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.710
- Really?
- Yes

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:44.630
Then why does it hurt so much?

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.210
Useless body

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:49.210
Hey

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:53.180
Why did you say you poisoned me?

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.640
If you pretended you didn't know anything,

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.470
you wouldn't be tortured

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.390
To make them believe that you are dying

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:05.520
Otherwise they wouldn't have opened your gates

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:08.020
Let's make an antidote

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.610
So you really risked your life

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:17.490
I thought they would cut off my arm or leg

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:19.950
But I'm fine

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:22.460
The people of Sosnovy Bor are too kind

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.330
If they torture people like that...

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.420
And you...

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:31.720
You look pretty sick

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.550
Why are you here?

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:37.100
Obviously, to take care of you

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.180
All students here are magicians

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:41.850
They shouldn't know about you

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:46.020
So I closed the door while no one was looking

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:49.610
changed your clothes, applied ointment to your wounds

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:52.190
I even gave you a massage when you lost consciousness

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.740
- Really?
- Yes

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:03.960
Only you can let me get so close to you

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:36.320
For my whole life

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:40.080
no one understood how desperate I was

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:44.910
And no one risked their life for me,

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.420
except you

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:03.930
Since I survived as promised,

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.180
I will treat you like a master

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:16.740
I have already changed 12 masters

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:20.740
Everyone thinks the teachers abandoned me, but it was me who left.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.870
And now I have found a true teacher

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.870
So I must get on my knees

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.210
and swear that I will always treat you like a teacher

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:34.710
On one condition

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:40.010
Don't tell anyone about our relationship

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:42.970
You will remain my master

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:46.220
and I'm your maid

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:50.900
And also,

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:55.730
our master-student relationship will last until you become the best

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:58.190
and help me get my energy back

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.530
Until then

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:05.990
When I get my power back and become Nak Soo,

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.540
we won't be master and student

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:13.420
Why is this?

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.090
Then

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:21.470
you won't have to protect me anymore

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:24.350
and I don't have to be

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.060
soft with you

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:40.700
Do you want to leave me when this is all over?

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.410
I see

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.410
Okay

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:49.870
You'll leave me when you don't need me anymore

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:52.580
Then I will respect your decision and let you go

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:01.550
And now kneel before the master

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:10.100
I, Chan Wook, your student,

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:13.690
I will serve and protect my master Moo Deok

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:35.520
You've got your look back

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:45.400
You won't go wild for a while

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:49.280
Then meet me at the palace

00:18:58.460 --> 00:19:01.040
Feed the soul swallower with human souls,

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:03.130
so that he is useful

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:08.220
You killed the gisaeng into whose body Nak Soo escaped

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:10.760
Yes. We dumped the body in Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:12.850
Have you checked for the blue mark?

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:19.770
No tag

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:22.570
This is not Nak Soo

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.690
Yes, I checked

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:30.240
The Nak Soo I knew wouldn't lose to you

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:33.620
but she apparently lost her strength

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.460
Can nomads lose strength?

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:39.870
If a strong soul

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:44.420
falls into the wrong body and is unable to access its power

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.260
Have you seen this before?

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:56.430
Your Majesty,

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.270
I am Jin Mu, Master Chan's student

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:00.190
I heard you asking me

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:11.570
Jin Mu

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:13.570
Yes

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:16.790
I'm not a king. It's me, Chang Gang

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:20.290
The soul of the king is now in my body

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:33.010
Master, is that you?

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:36.560
Yes, the king and I switched bodies

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:39.020
Then where is His Majesty?

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:40.890
His soul is in my body

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:43.560
I have to get my body back

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:46.650
But I can't use my strength

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:49.490
I need your help

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:52.280
Master

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:55.740
I don't know how soul alchemy works

00:20:56.580 --> 00:21:00.580
Go to Jeonbugwan's secret hall and bring back the Soul Reflector

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:04.210
I will teach you the alchemy of souls

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:10.010
He could not regain his strength due to his weak body,

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:12.090
so I got a chance

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:15.050
I'm lucky

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:19.470
Burn all these bodies

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:43.120
Search the gisaeng house where the murdered woman worked.

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:46.130
Find the owner of the spirit amulet

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:48.710
The main thing is unnoticed

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:50.380
Yes

00:22:05.140 --> 00:22:06.480
What are you doing?

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:09.570
It's cold

00:22:10.270 --> 00:22:12.240
The water is absolutely freezing

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:15.070
Of course it's cold. Why are you sitting there?

00:22:17.570 --> 00:22:20.080
This is the first time I feel such cold

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:23.910
I've passed out before because the energy gate was closed

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:26.210
And now, even though I’m shaking, I can stand

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:28.960
So my gates are indeed open

00:22:29.040 --> 00:22:31.460
If you master the spells, it won't be cold even on ice

00:22:31.550 --> 00:22:33.010
And the fire won't burn

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:35.970
What were you like before you changed your body?

00:22:36.050 --> 00:22:38.470
There were a lot of rumors about you

00:22:39.260 --> 00:22:40.560
But I've never seen you

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:42.930
I heard you were strong

00:22:44.350 --> 00:22:48.730
Not just strong, but very strong

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:51.020
"Very"? I see

00:22:51.110 --> 00:22:54.650
To become a better magician, you need to go through several stages

00:22:56.740 --> 00:22:59.320
First Chipsu, the ability to harness water energy

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:08.170
Second step - Ryusu, the ability to control the energy of water flow

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:11.710
Then Chisu - control of water energy

00:23:14.090 --> 00:23:15.210
in the atmosphere

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:19.390
I mastered all three stages

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:22.140
Few people in Deho are capable of this

00:23:22.720 --> 00:23:25.930
Master, you live up to your name

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:27.730
Yes

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:30.770
I moved silently, like a shadow,

00:23:31.480 --> 00:23:35.440
and the heads of my enemies fell to the ground as I passed by

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:37.700
I was Nak Soo

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:40.530
shadow warrior

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:55.420
I walked on water as if I was flying

00:23:56.380 --> 00:23:58.720
Where will I go - the wind rose

00:24:16.320 --> 00:24:19.860
And I’ll do this - it was raining

00:24:23.740 --> 00:24:27.450
I am Nak Soo, the best magician in the world,

00:24:28.040 --> 00:24:31.040
who can create snow and rain

00:24:35.090 --> 00:24:36.420
Are you okay?

00:24:38.590 --> 00:24:40.050
Just a couple of moves

00:24:40.880 --> 00:24:43.930
and your lungs are ready to explode

00:24:48.810 --> 00:24:49.730
What is it?

00:24:49.810 --> 00:24:51.890
My leg cramped!

00:24:51.980 --> 00:24:52.940
Spasm?

00:24:53.020 --> 00:24:56.230
These legs are short, thin, weak and cannot stand the cold

00:24:57.020 --> 00:24:58.860
Useless body

00:25:00.900 --> 00:25:04.740
Be careful. You are no longer Nak Soo, the shadow warrior.

00:25:04.820 --> 00:25:06.870
You are Moo Deok, my maid

00:25:06.950 --> 00:25:10.080
Don't jump around like you are now

00:25:10.750 --> 00:25:11.750
You'll get hurt

00:25:13.120 --> 00:25:14.670
I feel like nothing

00:25:18.630 --> 00:25:20.760
Don't be sad. You have me

00:25:20.840 --> 00:25:23.800
Let's start training, my gates are open

00:25:23.880 --> 00:25:26.140
But first, put on your shoes. It's cold

00:25:41.280 --> 00:25:42.650
For what?

00:25:43.240 --> 00:25:44.530
No agility

00:25:45.910 --> 00:25:46.740
Pick up

00:25:50.160 --> 00:25:51.290
What are you doing?

00:25:52.290 --> 00:25:55.710
Let's see how good my student is, then I will forget about sadness

00:25:55.790 --> 00:25:56.960
What?

00:26:10.350 --> 00:26:11.640
Why beat?

00:26:11.720 --> 00:26:13.730
You don't wield a sword

00:26:14.230 --> 00:26:15.310
Show me how you fight

00:26:31.660 --> 00:26:32.660
Here's a small one...

00:26:33.250 --> 00:26:34.290
It hurts!

00:26:46.800 --> 00:26:48.340
You fight badly too

00:26:50.050 --> 00:26:52.560
You're worse than I thought

00:26:52.640 --> 00:26:55.480
I never really studied!

00:26:59.650 --> 00:27:01.610
You had 12 teachers

00:27:02.230 --> 00:27:04.690
You haven't learned how to cast spells,

00:27:04.780 --> 00:27:08.160
but could learn martial arts

00:27:08.240 --> 00:27:10.410
I didn't have the mood for it

00:27:10.490 --> 00:27:11.490
As you know

00:27:11.580 --> 00:27:13.830
I need to get ready to do anything

00:27:14.660 --> 00:27:15.830
You're just lazy

00:27:16.330 --> 00:27:20.080
I noticed that you don't do anything at home

00:27:20.170 --> 00:27:22.290
Yes, I learned everything by heart. Check

00:27:22.380 --> 00:27:24.000
Do you think I recognized you?

00:27:24.090 --> 00:27:26.590
I realized that you are using Tansu style

00:27:27.090 --> 00:27:28.340
Just chatter

00:27:28.430 --> 00:27:29.930
I can do more than just talk

00:27:32.760 --> 00:27:34.640
Did you see it?

00:27:34.720 --> 00:27:36.350
I'm a fast learner

00:27:36.430 --> 00:27:39.310
I will quickly master Chipsa. How long does it take?

00:27:39.400 --> 00:27:41.520
I'm a fast learner too, but it took me five years

00:27:41.610 --> 00:27:43.400
And for others - 20 years

00:27:43.480 --> 00:27:44.610
And you...

00:27:46.150 --> 00:27:48.110
Maybe you'll master it even faster,

00:27:48.780 --> 00:27:50.160
since you are Chang Gan's son

00:27:51.200 --> 00:27:53.120
And what side is he here?

00:27:53.200 --> 00:27:56.080
He's a genius who mastered Chipsu in a year

00:27:56.790 --> 00:27:58.080
You will master Chipsa in a year,

00:27:58.160 --> 00:28:00.750
rumors that you are not his son will subside

00:28:00.830 --> 00:28:02.960
But of course this is hardly possible

00:28:03.460 --> 00:28:05.630
If it took him a year, I will master it in six months

00:28:05.710 --> 00:28:07.590
No, in three months

00:28:08.170 --> 00:28:09.010
Talking again

00:28:09.090 --> 00:28:12.010
I'm determined, don't knock me down

00:28:15.930 --> 00:28:18.180
Maid Kim told me to sweep the whole yard

00:28:18.680 --> 00:28:20.190
You've gotten better

00:28:20.270 --> 00:28:23.190
Yes, and you are doing well, so help me

00:28:26.150 --> 00:28:27.030
What...

00:28:28.820 --> 00:28:30.110
Moo Deok...

00:28:30.200 --> 00:28:34.580
I'm a lazy person who doesn't do anything without the right attitude.

00:28:36.450 --> 00:28:37.580
Good luck

00:28:38.830 --> 00:28:39.910
Bastard...

00:28:40.000 --> 00:28:42.080
- Well...
- It's so cool

00:28:42.170 --> 00:28:44.500
Useless lazy fellow!

00:28:44.590 --> 00:28:47.800
So cool, even cold

00:28:52.130 --> 00:28:57.060
Master Ho made medicine for Wook

00:28:57.600 --> 00:28:59.180
Apparently it's very effective

00:28:59.270 --> 00:29:03.060
Especially when its gates are open

00:29:04.190 --> 00:29:08.400
Maid Kim, you seem very pleased

00:29:09.940 --> 00:29:13.280
Are you so upset that his gates are open?

00:29:15.120 --> 00:29:18.240
You did nothing even when he was dying

00:29:19.330 --> 00:29:23.120
If it weren't for Master Huo, the young master might have died

00:29:23.210 --> 00:29:27.040
He had to find a way to save him without opening the gate

00:29:27.130 --> 00:29:28.380
How harmful you are

00:29:29.170 --> 00:29:32.050
You always kept your distance from the young master

00:29:32.130 --> 00:29:33.130
This...

00:29:34.220 --> 00:29:35.470
because of rumors?

00:29:41.430 --> 00:29:43.390
What rumors?

00:29:43.480 --> 00:29:44.730
Don't pretend you don't know

00:29:45.520 --> 00:29:47.520
You know there are rumors

00:29:47.610 --> 00:29:50.900
that you are Mr. Chan's father

00:29:52.360 --> 00:29:54.950
Don't you dare mention

00:29:56.740 --> 00:29:58.780
such absurd rumors!

00:29:59.700 --> 00:30:01.500
They're not that absurd

00:30:01.580 --> 00:30:04.710
Let's be honest, we both know

00:30:04.790 --> 00:30:07.630
that you loved Ms. Do Hwa before she got married

00:30:08.210 --> 00:30:11.920
You wrote her poems and gave her gifts

00:30:12.010 --> 00:30:13.170
I'm a living witness

00:30:13.920 --> 00:30:17.220
They say you still haven't gotten married because you haven't forgotten her

00:30:18.100 --> 00:30:19.560
What about you, Maid Kim?

00:30:20.220 --> 00:30:22.930
Are you still in love with Chang Gang?

00:30:23.520 --> 00:30:27.230
Is that why you didn't get married and live in his house?

00:30:27.860 --> 00:30:28.690
What?

00:30:28.770 --> 00:30:32.740
I know how much you liked him

00:30:34.070 --> 00:30:36.110
When he told you he liked acorn jelly,

00:30:36.200 --> 00:30:37.950
you climbed to the top of the mountain like a squirrel,

00:30:38.030 --> 00:30:39.950
- to collect acorns
- Squirrel?

00:30:40.030 --> 00:30:42.410
I saw you collecting acorns

00:30:46.540 --> 00:30:47.540
So what?

00:30:48.580 --> 00:30:52.840
Are you laughing at the fact that I went out collecting acorns?

00:30:55.130 --> 00:30:56.300
Yes!

00:30:56.930 --> 00:30:59.430
I admit that I went to collect them

00:31:00.010 --> 00:31:03.850
I could only express my feelings by making this jelly

00:31:04.730 --> 00:31:07.060
You can laugh at me all you want

00:31:14.400 --> 00:31:15.490
I'm not laughing

00:31:17.450 --> 00:31:19.620
When I saw you making this jelly,

00:31:21.530 --> 00:31:22.830
I felt sad

00:31:25.370 --> 00:31:27.080
I know what it's like

00:31:27.710 --> 00:31:30.790
when you can't do anything

00:31:31.540 --> 00:31:32.800
for the person you love

00:31:35.170 --> 00:31:36.300
Others

00:31:36.970 --> 00:31:39.550
may speak evil of us behind our backs

00:31:40.220 --> 00:31:43.640
But let's not do this to each other

00:31:46.230 --> 00:31:49.560
It's obvious that the love we felt

00:31:50.810 --> 00:31:53.400
when we were young

00:31:54.980 --> 00:31:56.900
ended up leaving a scar in our hearts

00:32:01.870 --> 00:32:05.290
I was on edge because of Mr. Chan.

00:32:06.160 --> 00:32:08.250
and said too much

00:32:08.330 --> 00:32:09.620
Forgive me

00:32:11.080 --> 00:32:13.920
I'm really worried about Uka

00:32:14.000 --> 00:32:17.670
I'm just afraid that if I open the gates of energy,

00:32:18.670 --> 00:32:22.300
we could break the barrier that protected him

00:32:22.390 --> 00:32:24.470
I'm uneasy about this

00:32:25.560 --> 00:32:27.980
I may have to suppress his will

00:32:29.810 --> 00:32:32.440
and stop in the future

00:32:34.900 --> 00:32:37.280
Please don't despise me for this

00:32:39.700 --> 00:32:40.990
Let's see how everything turns out

00:32:48.870 --> 00:32:51.580
Sir, this is wild ginseng tea

00:32:52.170 --> 00:32:53.460
Drink it

00:32:53.540 --> 00:32:54.670
Wild ginseng?

00:32:55.290 --> 00:32:57.000
I'll have a drink when I get back. Leave it here

00:32:57.090 --> 00:32:58.260
you again

00:32:58.840 --> 00:33:00.420
want to give it to Moo Deok?

00:33:01.010 --> 00:33:03.640
It's cold outside. She deserves something warm and nice

00:33:04.470 --> 00:33:07.010
Why did you make her sweep the yard in such cold weather?

00:33:08.350 --> 00:33:09.390
Listen

00:33:10.310 --> 00:33:12.600
This maid was cured for free

00:33:12.690 --> 00:33:14.610
So I asked her to do something in return.

00:33:14.690 --> 00:33:17.480
Why her? Couldn't you do it yourself?

00:33:18.650 --> 00:33:21.530
I needed to brew some medicine for you, cook dinner

00:33:21.610 --> 00:33:22.740
and take care of you

00:33:22.820 --> 00:33:25.280
Moo Deok will take care of me. You don't need to worry

00:33:28.450 --> 00:33:29.700
Clear

00:33:29.790 --> 00:33:32.000
You're only worried about Moo Deok

00:33:33.500 --> 00:33:35.080
Since I've become useless

00:33:35.170 --> 00:33:38.920
I'll go sweep the yard like Moo Deok

00:33:41.760 --> 00:33:46.390
I just feel like I've put too much on you

00:33:46.470 --> 00:33:49.560
How long have you been brewing this wild ginseng?

00:33:49.640 --> 00:33:51.520
I cooked it all day

00:33:51.600 --> 00:33:54.140
That's what I'm talking about. You couldn't even close your eyes

00:33:54.230 --> 00:33:56.900
How do you think this makes me feel?

00:33:58.110 --> 00:33:59.940
- Not good
- Exactly

00:34:00.030 --> 00:34:03.450
I know you've been through a lot because of me

00:34:04.820 --> 00:34:08.910
And he looks tired. You used to have porcelain skin

00:34:09.580 --> 00:34:11.700
You should drink wild ginseng tea

00:34:11.790 --> 00:34:15.040
Maybe then you'll stop getting into trouble?

00:34:15.120 --> 00:34:16.960
I don't know what to tell the boss

00:34:17.540 --> 00:34:18.960
I will accept his punishment

00:34:19.550 --> 00:34:22.880
Now my gates are open, which means I will become part of Sosnovy Bor

00:34:25.630 --> 00:34:29.100
Are you so happy that the gate is open?

00:34:29.720 --> 00:34:31.350
Yes, very much

00:34:32.100 --> 00:34:35.140
When I enter Sosnovy Bor and become better than Yulia and Dan Gu,

00:34:35.230 --> 00:34:37.650
they will regret not accepting me sooner

00:34:41.650 --> 00:34:43.530
Maid Kim, you can eat this ginseng

00:34:44.280 --> 00:34:46.610
Thanks for the ginseng, I really appreciate it

00:35:01.840 --> 00:35:04.720
You must be that evil maid

00:35:04.800 --> 00:35:06.760
What are you doing? We gave you medicine

00:35:06.840 --> 00:35:08.010
You might catch the disease

00:35:08.090 --> 00:35:10.800
I was cured for free

00:35:10.890 --> 00:35:13.430
so they said I should work to show my gratitude

00:35:13.520 --> 00:35:15.560
Maid Kim is a wise woman

00:35:16.060 --> 00:35:19.150
Sweep the yard, then bring fertilizer to the herb garden

00:35:20.020 --> 00:35:21.020
Yes

00:35:22.320 --> 00:35:23.570
Just wait, Ho Yeom

00:35:23.650 --> 00:35:26.030
Now I'm sweeping your yard

00:35:26.110 --> 00:35:27.990
but one day I will get rid of Saejukwon

00:35:31.490 --> 00:35:33.540
Hey! Watch where you're aiming

00:35:33.620 --> 00:35:35.250
Did you do this on purpose?

00:35:35.870 --> 00:35:36.750
No

00:35:36.830 --> 00:35:38.710
And I think so

00:35:38.790 --> 00:35:39.960
How dare I

00:35:44.000 --> 00:35:45.800
You are very strange

00:35:46.590 --> 00:35:47.840
These ears...

00:35:47.920 --> 00:35:50.800
I've seen them before

00:35:53.310 --> 00:35:56.810
Haven't I treated you in the past?

00:35:58.390 --> 00:36:01.480
Where do I get the money to get treatment in Sejukwon?

00:36:04.320 --> 00:36:07.490
These ears look familiar

00:36:12.780 --> 00:36:14.410
Sweep thoroughly

00:36:17.580 --> 00:36:18.910
He almost tore my ear off

00:36:19.750 --> 00:36:21.290
I know you're hurting, but just be patient.

00:36:21.380 --> 00:36:24.710
He's angry at Mr. Chan so he takes it out on you

00:36:24.800 --> 00:36:28.920
It’s normal to bully the weak, that’s how the world works.

00:36:29.010 --> 00:36:31.050
I'll just keep quiet

00:36:31.130 --> 00:36:33.180
Try not to hate him

00:36:33.260 --> 00:36:35.140
He gave away the flow of energy that cost him ten years,

00:36:35.220 --> 00:36:37.180
to help the young master recover faster

00:36:37.930 --> 00:36:39.810
Rest when you're done

00:36:43.690 --> 00:36:45.730
Energy flow of ten years?

00:36:57.370 --> 00:36:59.000
What took you so long?

00:36:59.080 --> 00:37:01.210
Come here, this is wild ginseng...

00:37:02.120 --> 00:37:03.210
What is it, Moo Deok?

00:37:03.290 --> 00:37:05.000
What are you doing?

00:37:05.880 --> 00:37:07.050
Stand still

00:37:07.920 --> 00:37:09.920
That's not why I brought you here

00:37:10.010 --> 00:37:12.260
Moo Deok, this is wrong. I'm your student, stop it

00:37:14.640 --> 00:37:15.850
That's it

00:37:20.890 --> 00:37:22.390
What are you doing?

00:37:22.480 --> 00:37:23.810
I'm testing the core of your energy

00:37:25.900 --> 00:37:27.020
Breathe calmly

00:37:43.960 --> 00:37:45.210
Here it is

00:37:46.960 --> 00:37:48.250
There is truth

00:37:49.500 --> 00:37:51.010
You are truly special

00:37:51.670 --> 00:37:52.880
Stop it

00:37:53.510 --> 00:37:55.390
What's inside of me?

00:37:55.470 --> 00:37:56.930
Incredible flow of energy

00:37:57.600 --> 00:37:59.890
Ho Yeom put energy into you

00:38:01.850 --> 00:38:03.230
Energy?

00:38:11.570 --> 00:38:14.150
It seems that Uk has already recovered

00:38:14.240 --> 00:38:16.870
It's time to extract the energy you put into it.

00:38:16.950 --> 00:38:20.040
If things go wrong, he might lose his mind.

00:38:20.740 --> 00:38:23.580
Uk won't be able to use it

00:38:24.460 --> 00:38:26.630
The gates of his energy have just opened

00:38:26.710 --> 00:38:29.130
There's really nothing he can do

00:38:29.210 --> 00:38:30.590
You're worrying in vain

00:38:31.250 --> 00:38:35.720
Most likely he doesn’t even know that there is something so incredible inside him

00:38:38.680 --> 00:38:40.760
Let's steal Ho Yeom's energy

00:38:42.850 --> 00:38:46.310
The core of your energy is filled with the energy that Ho Yeom gave you

00:38:47.270 --> 00:38:49.360
Now you are strong enough to easily use Chipsa

00:38:49.440 --> 00:38:52.190
I had no idea that there was something so valuable in me

00:38:52.280 --> 00:38:55.570
It takes ten years to collect that kind of energy, but you got it for free.

00:38:55.650 --> 00:38:57.860
Besides, this is Ho Yeom's energy, you can't ask for anything better

00:38:58.740 --> 00:39:00.120
You're a lucky fool

00:39:00.200 --> 00:39:04.450
I thought the old man hated me. I'm surprised he gave it to me

00:39:04.540 --> 00:39:07.540
He gave it to you to help you get better.

00:39:07.620 --> 00:39:08.880
He'll pick her up soon

00:39:08.960 --> 00:39:12.340
He can't do that. What's in my belly is mine

00:39:12.420 --> 00:39:14.510
If you don't have the strength to control her,

00:39:14.590 --> 00:39:17.470
your strength will disappear and he will take it away

00:39:17.550 --> 00:39:20.180
I have to learn to control the energy so I can keep it for myself.

00:39:20.260 --> 00:39:23.270
So I have to breathe as a source of energy

00:39:24.060 --> 00:39:27.100
I guess these 12 teachers taught you something at least

00:39:28.190 --> 00:39:29.270
You're right

00:39:30.560 --> 00:39:33.570
Energy from the core is controlled by breathing,

00:39:33.650 --> 00:39:35.860
however, all magicians breathe differently

00:39:35.940 --> 00:39:39.610
Everyone inhales and exhales different amounts of air.

00:39:40.740 --> 00:39:44.490
This is Ho Yeom's energy, so you need to control it with his breath

00:39:45.410 --> 00:39:47.370
I doubt he'll teach me

00:39:47.460 --> 00:39:50.580
Maybe we should just try everything? It's just breathing

00:39:51.330 --> 00:39:54.710
If you use someone's breath, you can lose control and go crazy

00:39:55.460 --> 00:39:59.630
Blood will flow from every part of your body and you will die.

00:39:59.720 --> 00:40:01.010
Well, shall we try?

00:40:02.220 --> 00:40:03.050
No

00:40:03.810 --> 00:40:06.270
You go to extremes

00:40:07.140 --> 00:40:10.310
Teacher, come up with a way that will keep me alive and allow me to control energy

00:40:11.560 --> 00:40:15.980
Basic breathing techniques are passed down from generation to generation.

00:40:16.070 --> 00:40:17.990
Ho Yeom from the Seo family

00:40:18.070 --> 00:40:21.200
This means that any member of the So family will use the same technique

00:40:24.530 --> 00:40:25.700
- Seo Yul
- Seo Yul

00:40:34.290 --> 00:40:36.500
Go ask him. You said you were close

00:40:36.590 --> 00:40:38.130
Yul is cautious

00:40:38.720 --> 00:40:42.010
If I ask, he will understand and tell Ho Yeom

00:40:43.760 --> 00:40:45.180
Just ten breaths...

00:40:45.260 --> 00:40:47.970
No, seven will be enough

00:40:48.060 --> 00:40:50.890
I can understand by placing my hand on the core of his energy

00:40:51.690 --> 00:40:53.860
He'll break your arm before he takes a breath.

00:40:54.520 --> 00:40:57.280
You're right, he's not like you

00:40:58.610 --> 00:40:59.690
Me?

00:41:00.990 --> 00:41:01.990
What's wrong with me?

00:41:04.070 --> 00:41:07.450
What? What kind of contemptuous look is this?

00:41:07.540 --> 00:41:10.870
Anyway, I don't think I can do to him what I did to you.

00:41:10.960 --> 00:41:12.420
No no, Moo Deok

00:41:12.500 --> 00:41:14.040
Look me in the eyes

00:41:14.130 --> 00:41:17.460
It’s inconvenient for you to touch him, but with me for once or twice?

00:41:17.550 --> 00:41:20.130
Like a child. Is this important now?

00:41:20.720 --> 00:41:21.800
Child?

00:41:23.260 --> 00:41:24.680
Yes, very important

00:41:24.760 --> 00:41:26.680
Are you crazy? What are you doing?

00:41:26.760 --> 00:41:27.600
I'm in perfect health

00:41:27.680 --> 00:41:30.020
- No, let's say that I'm crazy
- Well, let me go

00:41:32.890 --> 00:41:33.770
What are you doing here?

00:41:35.440 --> 00:41:36.360
Hello

00:41:38.360 --> 00:41:41.360
Why do you always bully Moo Deok?

00:41:41.990 --> 00:41:43.030
She hasn't recovered yet

00:41:43.110 --> 00:41:45.160
I didn't mock her

00:41:46.700 --> 00:41:48.200
- What?
- Here's a beetle

00:41:48.280 --> 00:41:49.870
I thought you were kind

00:41:51.200 --> 00:41:52.790
Moo Deok, are you okay?

00:41:54.670 --> 00:41:57.250
Your master is asking too much of you, isn't he?

00:41:57.340 --> 00:42:00.550
Not only do you take care of him, but also entertain him

00:42:00.630 --> 00:42:02.840
He asks for warm water, but when I bring it,

00:42:02.920 --> 00:42:04.340
asks for a cold one again...

00:42:04.430 --> 00:42:06.300
- Hey, what...
- He says the food is salty,

00:42:06.390 --> 00:42:08.050
but then complains that she is bland

00:42:08.140 --> 00:42:10.430
- Me?
- He is immature and moody

00:42:10.520 --> 00:42:12.890
Lazy but with high self-esteem

00:42:13.770 --> 00:42:15.060
But what can I do?

00:42:15.150 --> 00:42:16.440
He is my master

00:42:16.520 --> 00:42:18.480
so I have to serve him

00:42:19.150 --> 00:42:21.480
Moo Deok, it seems you managed to learn a lot about him

00:42:21.570 --> 00:42:22.900
I'm ashamed of you

00:42:24.070 --> 00:42:28.120
By the way, what are you doing here? Why aren't you in Sejukwon?

00:42:31.870 --> 00:42:34.500
We came to Yul

00:42:34.580 --> 00:42:35.790
Moo Deok asked me to come

00:42:38.210 --> 00:42:39.210
Yul?

00:42:40.170 --> 00:42:42.920
Why don't you approach him then?

00:42:44.010 --> 00:42:45.130
We spied on him

00:42:45.720 --> 00:42:49.350
Moo Deok was embarrassed to approach him,

00:42:49.430 --> 00:42:50.560
that's why I stayed with her

00:42:53.730 --> 00:42:57.150
Moo Deok, you probably like Yul

00:42:57.230 --> 00:42:59.230
- No...
- Dan Gu,

00:42:59.310 --> 00:43:01.190
you pick up on everything quickly

00:43:01.270 --> 00:43:03.110
I'm already embarrassed

00:43:03.190 --> 00:43:06.610
- Master! There was a misunderstanding
- Don't be shy

00:43:06.700 --> 00:43:09.620
Many girls like Yul

00:43:09.700 --> 00:43:11.370
- Your feelings are normal
- This is not...

00:43:11.450 --> 00:43:13.580
I will help Moo Deok

00:43:13.660 --> 00:43:15.250
Uk, go to the reception

00:43:15.330 --> 00:43:16.540
Why?

00:43:17.120 --> 00:43:18.170
Master Huo wants to see you

00:43:18.250 --> 00:43:19.250
Master Huo?

00:43:47.400 --> 00:43:49.110
I heard you calling me

00:43:51.240 --> 00:43:52.240
Yes

00:43:52.870 --> 00:43:55.370
The sound of your cough is pleasant and clear

00:43:55.450 --> 00:43:57.210
I think you feel much better

00:43:57.290 --> 00:43:59.670
I'm still dizzy and nauseous

00:44:00.330 --> 00:44:01.880
Plus I'm losing consciousness

00:44:02.500 --> 00:44:05.000
But thanks to you I'm getting better

00:44:05.090 --> 00:44:07.170
I saw you and your maid

00:44:07.260 --> 00:44:11.090
had fun walking this morning

00:44:11.180 --> 00:44:12.680
Isn't it strange?

00:44:13.890 --> 00:44:15.810
Hey, come on, stand here

00:44:16.680 --> 00:44:18.310
I need to take something from you

00:44:20.310 --> 00:44:21.150
But first

00:44:21.860 --> 00:44:23.770
I brought something for you

00:44:25.610 --> 00:44:26.570
For me?

00:44:27.240 --> 00:44:28.990
As a child

00:44:29.070 --> 00:44:31.320
I let a flock of sheep into your herb garden

00:44:31.410 --> 00:44:33.160
I know you hate me ever since

00:44:33.240 --> 00:44:36.910
Those sheep ate medicinal herbs

00:44:37.000 --> 00:44:38.910
and live to this day

00:44:39.000 --> 00:44:41.290
Despite this, you saved my life

00:44:41.370 --> 00:44:44.290
and allowed to live. I am deeply grateful to you for this

00:44:44.380 --> 00:44:46.550
I thought you were a real idiot

00:44:46.630 --> 00:44:49.720
but it seems you have learned to show gratitude

00:44:49.800 --> 00:44:51.840
I have prepared something for you

00:44:52.430 --> 00:44:53.470
Maid Kim

00:45:15.660 --> 00:45:19.250
This wine is made from meltwater from Volcano Island in South Daeho.

00:45:19.330 --> 00:45:22.540
The best dark wine in Daeho

00:45:24.130 --> 00:45:26.340
The gentleman said that he wanted to thank you,

00:45:26.420 --> 00:45:29.880
so I had to put in a lot of effort to get it

00:45:34.590 --> 00:45:36.180
This is a rare delicacy

00:45:40.560 --> 00:45:42.390
Is there only one bottle?

00:45:56.570 --> 00:46:00.290
You definitely know a lot about gratitude!

00:46:01.620 --> 00:46:04.870
Maid Kim, you raised him well

00:46:04.960 --> 00:46:06.420
Thank you

00:46:06.960 --> 00:46:08.420
Bring it here, quickly

00:46:09.130 --> 00:46:10.550
What a joy

00:46:14.220 --> 00:46:16.260
Three bottles?

00:46:21.680 --> 00:46:22.770
Mother

00:46:23.480 --> 00:46:25.730
The gates of Uka energy have opened

00:46:26.560 --> 00:46:30.940
Up to this point, we couldn't do anything because of the Gwangju order.

00:46:32.070 --> 00:46:35.660
Does this mean that we can now accept him into the family?

00:46:35.740 --> 00:46:39.330
This guy broke off his engagement after using you

00:46:40.240 --> 00:46:41.660
And do you still love him?

00:46:41.740 --> 00:46:44.620
I used it for my own purposes

00:46:45.120 --> 00:46:47.580
The gate of his energy was closed and I used it against him,

00:46:47.670 --> 00:46:49.380
forcing him to live with us

00:46:49.460 --> 00:46:51.050
Don't twist the truth

00:46:51.130 --> 00:46:54.510
He said that he would live with us if we help him open the gates of energy

00:46:54.590 --> 00:46:55.930
That's how he seduced you

00:46:59.220 --> 00:47:01.060
In the end it happened

00:47:01.140 --> 00:47:04.270
If you had opened its gates then,

00:47:04.350 --> 00:47:06.440
you would have a son-in-law

00:47:06.520 --> 00:47:10.650
and I would marry whoever I want

00:47:12.980 --> 00:47:14.110
Cho Young

00:47:14.990 --> 00:47:17.490
The son of the Chan family, whose gate of energy is open,

00:47:17.570 --> 00:47:19.740
will never be my son-in-law

00:47:21.120 --> 00:47:23.870
You should take your sister's place

00:47:24.660 --> 00:47:27.710
and become the head who protects Jinyeowon for the sake of the family

00:47:29.380 --> 00:47:31.710
Find a man who will support you

00:47:33.380 --> 00:47:35.130
If my sister hadn't died,

00:47:35.920 --> 00:47:38.090
I would marry my beloved

00:47:45.100 --> 00:47:46.890
Sorry mom

00:47:48.690 --> 00:47:52.190
Check whether Gwiga's urn has been collected or not

00:47:53.480 --> 00:47:54.690
Okay

00:48:41.610 --> 00:48:45.790
Uk broke Gwiga's urn

00:48:50.620 --> 00:48:52.790
What if I ask him to marry me in return?

00:48:53.750 --> 00:48:55.170
He will definitely refuse

00:49:01.090 --> 00:49:04.890
Does Mr. Yul sleep in the farthest room?

00:49:04.970 --> 00:49:08.180
Yes, he loves peace and quiet

00:49:09.890 --> 00:49:11.390
When does he go to bed?

00:49:11.890 --> 00:49:13.350
If he's not busy,

00:49:13.440 --> 00:49:16.650
goes to bed early and gets up early

00:49:18.030 --> 00:49:19.070
What?

00:49:19.150 --> 00:49:21.030
Do you want to visit his bedroom?

00:49:22.410 --> 00:49:24.490
No matter how much you like him, it's wrong

00:49:27.540 --> 00:49:28.790
Hint

00:49:28.870 --> 00:49:31.790
He always eats at the same time, you can see him at lunch

00:49:33.000 --> 00:49:34.250
Okay

00:49:34.330 --> 00:49:37.630
I need more than to see. I need to touch it

00:49:55.270 --> 00:49:56.860
We're Doc, are you okay?

00:50:00.900 --> 00:50:02.070
Yul...

00:50:05.200 --> 00:50:07.740
Outsiders are not allowed to read books in Jeongjingak

00:50:08.530 --> 00:50:10.910
She only helps

00:50:11.000 --> 00:50:12.870
Yes, and spells are written in them

00:50:12.960 --> 00:50:14.830
She still won't understand

00:50:16.710 --> 00:50:17.960
And you're smart

00:50:19.300 --> 00:50:20.880
Do you know martial arts?

00:50:23.880 --> 00:50:26.640
I learned to dance in the gisaeng house

00:50:29.810 --> 00:50:31.430
That's why I'm fast

00:50:35.770 --> 00:50:38.900
Where's Don Yi? Gotta ask something

00:50:41.480 --> 00:50:44.360
Dong Yi is not here, but Moo Deok is

00:50:44.990 --> 00:50:47.370
Moo Deok, help him

00:50:47.450 --> 00:50:48.740
I'll help

00:50:48.820 --> 00:50:50.830
No need

00:51:07.130 --> 00:51:09.220
Help, young master?

00:51:13.060 --> 00:51:15.940
Sir, are you hungry? What to bring?

00:51:17.600 --> 00:51:20.190
Sir, I...

00:51:32.740 --> 00:51:36.330
The magicians of Chongjingak live here. Don't follow me

00:51:41.750 --> 00:51:45.130
If he goes to bed early, it means he's going to bed.

00:51:58.770 --> 00:52:00.100
Is this the restroom?

00:52:08.490 --> 00:52:10.740
I told you to leave. Why are you here?

00:52:13.450 --> 00:52:17.870
I thought maybe I could help with something

00:52:18.910 --> 00:52:19.750
to you

00:52:21.170 --> 00:52:22.790
do you need something from me?

00:52:27.880 --> 00:52:30.510
Just touch you. And this is a chance

00:52:31.390 --> 00:52:34.140
Why did you follow me all the way to the men's room?

00:53:08.130 --> 00:53:11.340
This is my chance. Six breaths and I will understand how he breathes

00:53:14.220 --> 00:53:15.180
One

00:53:16.310 --> 00:53:17.140
Two

00:53:20.020 --> 00:53:21.190
Three

00:53:21.890 --> 00:53:23.020
Four

00:53:39.200 --> 00:53:40.250
Why did you do this?

00:53:40.830 --> 00:53:43.000
I was so close

00:53:43.080 --> 00:53:45.170
I know that you and Uk were looking at me from afar

00:53:45.250 --> 00:53:46.710
Why are you following me?

00:53:48.090 --> 00:53:50.550
Just one breath

00:53:51.590 --> 00:53:52.470
Answer

00:53:53.220 --> 00:53:54.720
I love you!

00:54:20.620 --> 00:54:21.620
Are you okay?

00:54:22.710 --> 00:54:24.000
It hurts

00:54:40.140 --> 00:54:43.810
You are interested in my breathing technique. Trying to reach the core of my energy

00:54:44.560 --> 00:54:46.400
I'm telling you, I love you

00:54:46.480 --> 00:54:47.940
You lie so skillfully

00:54:48.810 --> 00:54:50.820
And earlier it was not dance, but martial arts

00:54:51.400 --> 00:54:53.030
My life was hard

00:54:53.110 --> 00:54:55.530
so I learned a couple of moves for safety's sake

00:54:55.610 --> 00:54:57.200
Is this for Uka?

00:54:59.490 --> 00:55:02.410
I think he's trying to control the energy inside

00:55:02.500 --> 00:55:05.410
But he can't succeed even with my technique.

00:55:08.830 --> 00:55:11.130
Stop wasting time. Get better and go away

00:55:31.070 --> 00:55:32.980
So do you remember me

00:55:33.980 --> 00:55:35.110
Yul

00:57:01.360 --> 00:57:05.120
I didn't ignore you because I hated you

00:57:05.200 --> 00:57:08.750
Your mom Do Hwa was like a daughter to me

00:57:09.330 --> 00:57:11.670
I'm someone like your grandfather

00:57:13.960 --> 00:57:15.340
Juvenile scoundrel

00:57:17.760 --> 00:57:19.630
Yes, grandpa

00:57:22.840 --> 00:57:27.010
Your mother was very kind

00:57:28.770 --> 00:57:30.060
Really?

00:57:30.730 --> 00:57:34.230
Yes! You should know this

00:57:34.310 --> 00:57:37.440
Remember this and don’t pay attention to other people’s words

00:57:40.950 --> 00:57:42.200
This poor child...

00:57:45.280 --> 00:57:49.160
Length and depth of inhalations and exhalations

00:58:01.300 --> 00:58:03.340
It's hard to play. I'm impressed

00:58:04.840 --> 00:58:06.760
I can do a lot

00:58:08.430 --> 00:58:09.680
Give it back

00:58:15.150 --> 00:58:17.190
He seems to be many years old

00:58:17.270 --> 00:58:19.730
Why do you need something so old?

00:58:23.570 --> 00:58:25.240
It belongs to an old friend

00:58:31.370 --> 00:58:34.210
Instead of a friend nearby, you have a whistle

00:58:35.170 --> 00:58:37.040
It means your friend left you

00:58:41.380 --> 00:58:42.550
Yes

00:58:43.380 --> 00:58:44.880
This belongs to that friend

00:58:47.800 --> 00:58:49.720
Give me back, he means a lot to me

00:58:51.310 --> 00:58:55.310
In return, teach me your breathing technique.

00:58:57.900 --> 00:59:00.400
You said it's no use anyway

00:59:00.480 --> 00:59:02.690
This is also useless to me

00:59:03.490 --> 00:59:04.610
Let's change

00:59:08.070 --> 00:59:09.870
To me it's trash

00:59:10.830 --> 00:59:12.370
I can break it

00:59:29.760 --> 00:59:31.260
Just three breaths

01:00:12.430 --> 01:00:14.470
Where is she?

01:00:40.920 --> 01:00:43.170
What's that facial expression?

01:00:43.710 --> 01:00:46.050
Doesn't look like you

01:00:48.590 --> 01:00:49.760
I like him

01:00:54.470 --> 01:00:56.060
You've got it all twisted up like that

01:00:56.890 --> 01:01:00.310
I followed Yul and repeated that I liked him, and now I found out

01:01:00.390 --> 01:01:01.600
I see

01:01:02.440 --> 01:01:05.440
You are a sensitive person who kills everyone in your path,

01:01:05.520 --> 01:01:08.780
but I decided to flirt with the guy for the sake of my student

01:01:09.820 --> 01:01:11.030
What about you?

01:01:11.110 --> 01:01:13.780
I hope you didn't let Ho Yeom take away his energy

01:01:13.870 --> 01:01:16.200
The strength is in me. And I learned his breathing technique

01:01:16.290 --> 01:01:17.740
So you wasted your time

01:01:17.830 --> 01:01:20.370
Did you find out? Don't lie to me

01:01:21.000 --> 01:01:22.290
I'm sure you're lying

01:01:22.370 --> 01:01:24.540
to pretend that you did something worthwhile

01:01:24.630 --> 01:01:26.670
I was breathing like this. how is he

01:01:26.750 --> 01:01:29.050
And I think I felt something moving inside me

01:01:37.220 --> 01:01:38.930
Energy is boiling inside you

01:01:40.350 --> 01:01:41.690
It worked

01:01:44.440 --> 01:01:46.150
Were you that close to Yul?

01:01:47.770 --> 01:01:49.860
Carefully. I still see the mark in your eyes

01:01:51.110 --> 01:01:52.860
I used eye drops

01:01:53.820 --> 01:01:56.490
I didn't see the mark in the mirror. You can see it, right?

01:01:56.580 --> 01:01:58.120
This is how you look

01:01:58.200 --> 01:02:00.160
If you really like him, this is how you should approach him

01:02:00.250 --> 01:02:02.040
Be careful with love

01:02:03.790 --> 01:02:05.080
Only I can be allowed to do this

01:02:07.750 --> 01:02:10.340
Okay. Now only you can

01:02:12.300 --> 01:02:14.130
I'll try not to fall in love with Yulia

01:02:15.840 --> 01:02:16.890
What?

01:02:16.970 --> 01:02:19.060
Why does this take effort?

01:02:19.770 --> 01:02:21.270
He's handsome

01:02:21.350 --> 01:02:24.190
It takes effort not to fall in love with a handsome man

01:02:24.270 --> 01:02:25.480
What about me?

01:02:25.560 --> 01:02:28.730
I think it was much more difficult not to fall in love with me

01:02:28.820 --> 01:02:29.940
Not at all

01:02:30.940 --> 01:02:32.820
Why not? It doesn't make sense

01:02:32.900 --> 01:02:35.450
- Say it was difficult
- Yes, master

01:02:35.530 --> 01:02:37.280
- Tell me seriously
- Yes

01:02:37.370 --> 01:02:39.200
- Are you going to say that?
- Yes

01:02:39.280 --> 01:02:40.700
Come on, make me laugh

01:04:15.550 --> 01:04:16.720
Your Highness

01:04:17.630 --> 01:04:19.890
Judging by the energy on your sword,

01:04:19.970 --> 01:04:22.720
you have mastered the highest degree of Ryusu

01:04:25.680 --> 01:04:27.310
All thanks to you

01:04:28.390 --> 01:04:29.900
Gyeongju's deputy

01:04:29.980 --> 01:04:32.650
The only one who can compete with you

01:04:32.730 --> 01:04:34.980
I think only Seo Yul is from the Seo family

01:04:35.820 --> 01:04:39.490
Her Majesty the Queen and Julia's father, General So, brother and sister

01:04:39.570 --> 01:04:41.700
Yul and I were very close as children,

01:04:41.780 --> 01:04:43.700
but everything changed when he entered Sosnovy Bor

01:04:46.120 --> 01:04:49.960
Seo Yul, Park Dan Gu, Chan Wook and Jin Cho Young are famous

01:04:50.040 --> 01:04:51.790
like Four Seasons

01:04:52.880 --> 01:04:54.420
Let them have fun

01:04:55.130 --> 01:04:56.050
Wait a minute

01:04:56.130 --> 01:04:58.840
Why is Chan Wook also among them when he doesn’t have magic?

01:04:59.800 --> 01:05:01.390
Now owns

01:05:02.090 --> 01:05:03.510
His gates of energy are open

01:05:04.300 --> 01:05:05.970
Is the gate open?

01:05:09.270 --> 01:05:11.270
But there's only so much he can do

01:05:11.350 --> 01:05:13.770
He is the son of Jang Gang, Gwangju Jeonbugwan

01:05:15.270 --> 01:05:16.360
Recently

01:05:16.440 --> 01:05:19.150
he came and asked about Nak Su's sword

01:05:21.320 --> 01:05:22.160
And?

01:05:25.200 --> 01:05:27.200
Are you afraid that I will succeed?

01:05:27.290 --> 01:05:28.580
So did you give it away?

01:05:28.660 --> 01:05:31.120
His Majesty ordered you to keep it in Jeonbugwan

01:05:31.210 --> 01:05:34.630
Gwangju Post belongs to the Jang family

01:05:35.290 --> 01:05:36.550
There was no choice

01:05:38.880 --> 01:05:40.510
How rude

01:05:40.590 --> 01:05:42.470
He looks down on me

01:05:43.300 --> 01:05:45.550
Still, I was his father's student

01:05:45.640 --> 01:05:49.020
Come to think of it, I wasn't officially his student

01:05:50.270 --> 01:05:53.150
I had nowhere to go when the Jin family threw me out,

01:05:54.060 --> 01:05:56.060
he took me as a servant

01:05:56.860 --> 01:05:59.190
You are the teacher of the Crown Prince of this country

01:05:59.280 --> 01:06:01.030
How dare he?

01:06:01.110 --> 01:06:02.990
It's like looking down on me

01:06:03.070 --> 01:06:05.200
I apologize for

01:06:06.160 --> 01:06:09.290
that your teacher does not come from a noble family

01:06:14.040 --> 01:06:15.290
We need it soon

01:06:16.170 --> 01:06:18.500
put Chan Wook in his place

01:06:39.150 --> 01:06:41.690
This is the sword of Gwangju Chan, to Chan Wook's father

01:06:43.200 --> 01:06:44.280
I somehow...

01:06:45.360 --> 01:06:47.740
promised to accept him if he exposed

01:06:48.490 --> 01:06:50.120
his father's sword

01:06:50.200 --> 01:06:52.790
Now the gates of his energy are open and it is possible

01:06:53.370 --> 01:06:56.540
Will you allow him to become the magician of Sosnovy Bor?

01:06:58.960 --> 01:07:01.630
Bring Uka

01:07:10.970 --> 01:07:14.230
What did you say? Who is his father?

01:07:15.020 --> 01:07:16.440
The deceased king

01:07:17.810 --> 01:07:19.690
He is the king's son!

01:07:22.030 --> 01:07:23.650
So he is the king's son,

01:07:24.570 --> 01:07:27.200
who died a year ago?

01:07:27.780 --> 01:07:29.120
The deceased king

01:07:29.780 --> 01:07:32.620
died due to illness without being able to move

01:07:32.700 --> 01:07:33.870
How is this possible?

01:07:33.950 --> 01:07:35.540
On this baby's birthday,

01:07:36.500 --> 01:07:39.130
the king's new star shone in the sky

01:07:40.750 --> 01:07:43.630
The brother of the deceased king has already taken the throne,

01:07:44.340 --> 01:07:46.470
which his son will inherit

01:07:46.550 --> 01:07:49.680
If the royal family finds out that this is the king's son,

01:07:50.550 --> 01:07:52.390
he will be perceived

01:07:53.520 --> 01:07:54.810
as a threat

01:07:59.940 --> 01:08:02.400
His existence will bring chaos

01:08:03.400 --> 01:08:06.030
He shouldn't attract attention to himself

01:08:08.030 --> 01:08:10.530
People must think there is nothing unusual about him

01:08:16.290 --> 01:08:18.000
I sincerely apologize

01:08:18.670 --> 01:08:21.250
for all the problems I created

01:08:23.840 --> 01:08:25.880
Sosnovy Bor decided

01:08:26.550 --> 01:08:28.300
open the gates of your energy,

01:08:29.010 --> 01:08:30.680
so you are not responsible

01:08:32.220 --> 01:08:34.180
I, Chan Wook, the eldest son of the Chan family,

01:08:34.260 --> 01:08:36.060
ready to learn and practice

01:08:36.890 --> 01:08:39.270
If Sosnovy Bor gives me a chance, I will do my best

01:08:40.520 --> 01:08:42.650
As a sign of your loyalty,

01:08:42.730 --> 01:08:45.570
I will give you the sword Nak Soo took from Jin Mu,

01:08:46.400 --> 01:08:48.150
so that it is stored in the Sosnovy Bor armory

01:08:50.910 --> 01:08:52.280
No need

01:08:55.700 --> 01:09:00.460
The sword belongs to the Chan family, let it be kept by you

01:09:07.210 --> 01:09:10.430
You can take your father's sword

01:09:11.890 --> 01:09:15.970
From now on, I forbid Chan Wook from entering Sosnovy Bor

01:09:22.020 --> 01:09:23.610
You are free to come

01:09:24.150 --> 01:09:26.730
like the son of an old friend

01:09:27.780 --> 01:09:32.700
But you do not have the right to become a magician of Sosnovy Bor

01:09:34.070 --> 01:09:35.740
Now

01:09:35.830 --> 01:09:39.620
Chan Wook will not have access to anything in the forest

01:09:42.670 --> 01:09:46.880
Give me the amulet that allows you to pass here

01:09:51.970 --> 01:09:53.220
I don't have it

01:09:54.010 --> 01:09:54.840
What?

01:09:56.810 --> 01:09:58.140
I'm lost

01:10:00.850 --> 01:10:02.020
spirit amulet

01:10:02.100 --> 01:10:04.600
What punishment is provided for those

01:10:05.560 --> 01:10:07.270
who will lose the amulet?

01:10:08.530 --> 01:10:10.530
Spanking, 100 strokes, master

01:10:10.610 --> 01:10:13.200
Then I give Chan Wook a hundred blows

01:10:13.280 --> 01:10:15.320
for the loss of the amulet

01:10:51.860 --> 01:10:54.320
He has the energy of Master Huo, everything will be fine

01:10:54.900 --> 01:10:57.740
If you get in, he'll have more problems.

01:11:42.290 --> 01:11:44.370
Chan Wook, leave Sosnovy Bor

01:11:44.450 --> 01:11:46.460
and don't come here again

01:11:51.340 --> 01:11:52.380
Go away

01:11:54.380 --> 01:11:55.670
No

01:11:55.760 --> 01:11:56.800
No...

01:11:57.630 --> 01:11:58.840
I can't leave like this

01:12:00.510 --> 01:12:02.600
I've been hit 99 times

01:12:04.560 --> 01:12:05.980
One hit left

01:12:08.520 --> 01:12:10.020
And this last one

01:12:11.690 --> 01:12:13.110
apply it yourself

01:12:29.870 --> 01:12:32.040
I'm just trying to keep him safe

01:12:32.630 --> 01:12:36.380
If his energy gates are not opened and he lives like my son, he will survive

01:12:36.460 --> 01:12:39.590
But if he decides to try his luck,

01:12:41.800 --> 01:12:43.930
death awaits him

01:13:00.660 --> 01:13:03.700
Uk, just give up

01:13:04.990 --> 01:13:06.950
and live quietly

01:13:09.040 --> 01:13:10.670
This is the only way you will survive

01:13:40.950 --> 01:13:42.200
Moo Deok,

01:13:44.370 --> 01:13:45.870
take the sword

01:14:18.940 --> 01:14:19.780
We're leaving

01:14:53.280 --> 01:15:04.700
/////////////////////////////////////

01:15:01.280 --> 01:15:12.700
Thanks for watching with us!
Space for your advertising

01:15:12.700 --> 01:15:15.660
Alchemy

01:15:12.700 --> 01:15:15.660
Shower

01:15:15.710 --> 01:15:18.080
I want to bare it and show them

01:15:18.170 --> 01:15:19.960
- Is this a sign of stupidity?
- No, strength

01:15:20.040 --> 01:15:21.050
Stand your ground

01:15:21.130 --> 01:15:23.260
There is another sword that you cannot draw

01:15:23.340 --> 01:15:26.090
But it belongs to his father

01:15:26.180 --> 01:15:28.430
I have to pick him up

01:15:28.510 --> 01:15:30.430
Whoever wins takes it

01:15:30.510 --> 01:15:33.560
Going against the prince is a sign of stupidity

01:15:33.640 --> 01:15:37.060
But some believe it is a show of strength. I have to try

01:15:38.100 --> 01:15:40.820
My student is too weak to fight against you

01:15:41.770 --> 01:15:43.480
He needs to be put in danger again

01:15:44.240 --> 01:15:46.650
And he'll get what he wants
